    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nInterested in this property? Sign up for mySherryFitz to arrange your viewing, see current offers or make your own offer. Register now at SherryFitz.ie\nThis robust, first floor apartment is located in a small commercial block on Burrin Road, immediately adjacent to the Fair Green Shopping Centre and close to all town amenities.\nDating from 2002 the interior extends to 87 sq m and currently presents as a three-bed-two-bath configuration. The entire is very generously proportioned with twin aspect windows to its rear and access via a shared staircase with one other apartment unit.\nIt enjoys mains services, electric heating and communal parking on the forecourt immediately outside.\nThe apartment is perfectly configured to suit student or general rental or indeed could comfortably be interpreted for owner occupation, such is its scale.\nViewings are highly recommended and invited on a strictly appointment basis."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nHall - \nTeak front door from inner hall. Common staircase to 1st floor landing. Fire porch to front.\n\nHall - 7.48m x 1.48m\nTeak hall door. L-shaped hall, ceramic tiled floor. Intercom. Attic access hatch.\n\nBedroom 1 - 4.37m x 4.31m\nDouble room, window to front, blind. Laminate timber floor. Built in wardrobes.\n\nBedrroom 2 - 4.15m x 1.73m\nDouble room. Window to rear. Blinds. Built in wardrobes.\n\nBathroom - 3.26m x 1.73m\nWindow to rear. Ceramic tiled floor. Part tiled walls. PVC panelled ceiling . Toilet, sink & shower cubicle. Tritton T90i electric shower. Hot press off. Electric shower. Extractor fan.\n\nBedroom 3 - 3.30m x 3.15m\nDouble room. Window to rear. Blinds. Laminate timber floor. Built in wardrobes.\n\nShower Room - 2.05m x 1.71m\nCeramic tiled floor & part tiled walls. PVC panelled ceiling. Toilet, sink & shower cubicle. T90i electric shower. Extractor fan.\n\nKitchen/Diner/Lounge - 4.77m x 4.34m\nTwin windows to front. Curtains, pole & blinds. Marley flooring. Fitted floor & wall units. Part tiled walls.\n\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li>Dual aspect 1st floor apartment </li><li>Shared Staiwell( 2 apartments) </li><li>Parking </li><li>Hollow core floors</li><li>3 bed - 2 bath</li><li>Electric heating </li><li>Fibre broadband</li><li>Town centre location</ul>"
      },
